#: ../../docs/index.md:16
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Demarrer"

#: ../../docs/index.md:1 e28bb743ab8f401780805051dfd27648
msgid "SeCuReDmE Developer Library"
msgstr "Bibliotheque developpeur SeCuReDmE"

#: ../../docs/index.md:3 1b89dd73d1b84c09a3ddc5d28b417c61
msgid ""
"Public technical documentation for the twelve tools in the SeCuReDmE "
"Education suite. The catalogue tells you where to enter; this library "
"explains how each system runs, what it validates, and where human review "
"remains mandatory."
msgstr ""
"Documentation technique publique des douze outils de la suite SeCuReDmE "
"Education. Le catalogue indique ou entrer; cette bibliotheque explique "
"comment chaque systeme fonctionne, ce qu'il valide et ou la revision humaine"
" demeure obligatoire."

#: ../../docs/index.md:6 d7d2bc9f4bd44a01a909b0e32ab53368
msgid ""
"Generated output, simulations, classifications, and agent suggestions remain"
" reviewable artifacts. They do not become scientific, legal, security, "
"clinical, or editorial authority by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Les sorties generees, simulations, classifications et suggestions d'agents "
"restent des artefacts a reviser. Elles ne deviennent pas, a elles seules, "
"une autorite scientifique, juridique, securitaire, clinique ou editoriale."

#: ../../docs/index.md:9 866542ed47ed4f27adc0a21b8bf5a7f0
msgid "Start with the route that matches your work"
msgstr "Commencez par la route qui correspond a votre travail"

#: ../../docs/index.md:11 0fdd6c774c884a49af36b69ed27b4a10
msgid ""
"[Start in 15 minutes](getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md) to learn the "
"common operating method."
msgstr ""
"[Start in 15 minutes](getting-started/15-minute-tutorial.md) to learn the "
"common operating method."

#: ../../docs/index.md:12 7315c81364b744958878843f27a0beae
msgid ""
"[Open the tool library](tools/index.md) for installation, interfaces, tests,"
" and public boundaries."
msgstr ""
"[Open the tool library](tools/index.md) for installation, interfaces, tests,"
" and public boundaries."

#: ../../docs/index.md:13 1c4ca878f2b7412eb53cef50c10dffa1
msgid ""
"[Use the 40 collaboration contracts](prompts/index.md) when you need a "
"bounded, reusable prompt."
msgstr ""
"[Use the 40 collaboration contracts](prompts/index.md) when you need a "
"bounded, reusable prompt."

#: ../../docs/index.md:14 3dbf14da7b9e486297c618048da7724d
msgid ""
"[Browse the video library](media/video-library.md) to connect short "
"explanations with long-form walkthroughs."
msgstr ""
"[Browse the video library](media/video-library.md) to connect short "
"explanations with long-form walkthroughs."

#: ../../docs/index.md:26 4eddc1492038409ca997d5acc00c39fa
msgid "Documentation contract"
msgstr "Contrat documentaire"

#: ../../docs/index.md:28 9c6cdd154577486bb279193901f9cd3f
msgid ""
"Every tool documents the same technical surface: status, prerequisites, "
"installation, quickstart, architecture, interfaces, configuration, examples,"
" tests, security, troubleshooting, contribution, releases, and source links."
" The repository that implements the tool remains authoritative; Scholarium "
"aggregates and validates its public documentation."
msgstr ""
"Chaque outil documente la meme surface technique : statut, prerequis, "
"installation, demarrage rapide, architecture, interfaces, configuration, "
"exemples, tests, securite, depannage, contribution, versions et liens "
"source. Le depot qui implemente l'outil demeure la reference; Scholarium "
"agrege et valide sa documentation publique."

#: ../../docs/index.md:30 c0f23094baf54b9f8f4e282a858b846b
msgid "Public entry point"
msgstr "Porte d'entree publique"

#: ../../docs/index.md:32 89c2875763f54b0caaa6e11fbcc80c14
msgid ""
"The human-facing catalogue remains [SeCuReDmE "
"Education](https://securedme.ca/product/education/). Browser-ready tools "
"open their real application. Local, CLI, API, and research tools open a full"
" technical route instead of a simulated dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Le catalogue destine aux personnes demeure [SeCuReDmE "
"Education](https://securedme.ca/product/education/). Les outils web ouvrent "
"leur application reelle. Les outils locaux, CLI, API et de recherche ouvrent"
" une route technique complete plutot qu'un tableau de bord simule."
